 (OUT/'session-state.md').write_text('All eight independent checks complete and passed. Native grader 22 accepted/88 rejected. Requested delivery 5/5 and fresh delivery 8/8 at basis 6415. Five actual UI captures manually inspected. result.json accepted; validate_review passed; binding in reviewed-inputs.json. Await final portable-regression syntactic guard confirmation for supplemental mapping evidence only.\n')
